# MTL for Gazebo — BaseColor maps only (normal/roughness/metallic maps left out
# to avoid the lumpy ogre2 artifacts seen before). Kd 1 1 1 so the albedo map
# is not darkened. Textures renamed space-free for reliable parsing.

newmtl Green_Leather
Ka 1 1 1
Kd 1 1 1
Ks 0.05 0.05 0.05
illum 2
